msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Request access to the Constrained Quantum Optimizer by Aqarios](https://aqarios.com/qiskit-function-access/).\n"
"  - Visit the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer/api-reference) for the complete parameter and output documentation.\n"
"  - Try the [Find the Maximum Independent Set with the Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) tutorial for a deep-dive into a real QOBLIB benchmark instance.\n"
"  - Review the publication [Constrained Quantum Optimization via Iterative Warm-Start XY-Mixers](https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/ae8ea2).\n"
"  - Review the [functions overview](/guides/functions), includes cost per execution.\n"
"  - Learn about [managed workflows](/guides/managed-workflows).\n"
"  - Understand [resource units (RUs)](/guides/plans-overview#rus).\n"
"  - Learn how to choose [problem sizes and compute profiles](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
"  - Review the [IBM Quantum Platform plans](/guides/plans-overview).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendações\">\n"
"  - [Solicite acesso ao Constrained Quantum Optimizer da Aqarios](https://aqarios.com/qiskit-function-access/).\n"
"  - Visite a [referência da API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/functions/aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer/api-reference) para a documentação completa de parâmetros e saídas.\n"
"  - Experimente o tutorial [Find the Maximum Independent Set with the Aqarios Constrained Quantum Optimizer](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) para um aprofundamento em uma instância real de benchmark do QOBLIB.\n"
"  - Leia a publicação [Constrained Quantum Optimization via Iterative Warm-Start XY-Mixers](https://doi.org/10.1088/1367-2630/ae8ea2).\n"
"  - Consulte a [visão geral das funções](/guides/functions), que inclui o custo por execução.\n"
"  - Saiba mais sobre os [fluxos de trabalho gerenciados](/guides/managed-workflows).\n"
"  - Entenda as [unidades de recurso (RUs)](/guides/plans-overview#rus).\n"
"  - Saiba como escolher [tamanhos de problema e perfis de computação](/guides/managed-workflow-compute-profiles).\n"
"  - Consulte os [planos do IBM Quantum Platform](/guides/plans-overview).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

